## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical ability to gate deployments by cost in a multi-region, multi-account setup, and to automate cross-account IAM, CodePipeline controls, and DR playbooks.

## Key Concepts
- AWS Budgets and CloudWatch alarms
- Cross-account IAM roles and resource sharing
- CodePipeline DisableStageTransition/EnableStageTransition
- Lambda-driven automation and guardrails
- DR runbook and rollback planning

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: disable prod stage when budget alarm triggers
const codepipeline = new AWS.CodePipeline();
codepipeline.disableStageTransition({
  pipelineName: 'svc-pipeline',
  stageName: 'Deploy',
  reason: 'Cost threshold exceeded'
}, (err, data) => {
  if (err) console.error(err);
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
